e family circle and invite members with a secure 6-digit code. Once they join and grant permission, you can view their real-time location on a dedicated private map.\n\nPlace Alerts\nAdd important places such as home, school, or work for selected family members. When they arrive at or leave a saved place, you can receive timely notifications.\n\nEmergency SOS\nIn an emergency, one tap sends an instant SOS alert to circle members, including the sender’s updated real-time location.\n\nLocation History\nView members’ location history to better understand daily routes, check past movements, or help find a lost device.\n\nPrivacy First\nAll members must install the app voluntarily and grant location permission before sharing begins. Location services require prior consent from the person being located.\n\nPrivacy Policy:\nhttps://www.ltinhlab.com/policy/locfam/privacy_policy.html\n\nTerms of Use:\nhttps://www.ltinhlab.com/policy/locfam/terms_of_use.html", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "sellerName": "Linh Nguyen", "userRatingCount": 0}]}